    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d100">

                <pb facs="0209" n="963" xml:id="pg963"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72112/5054</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Barranquilla</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Guyant</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Barranquilla</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-10-10T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 10, 1917, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received October 11, 3.45
                        p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Shall we continue to certify invoices from German and pro-German firms?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Guyant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
